    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_02",
      "hash64": "0E6C3E1207302992",
      "text": "En fait... faut que je te parle.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_03",
      "hash64": "0E6C3F1207302B45",
      "text": "C’est par rapport au... euh... truc... qu’on a vu\\nhier. T’en as parlé à personne, hein ? Hein ?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_select_01",
      "hash64": "04F744F15E1EA0FF",
      "text": "Je suis resté[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e muet[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0200)]te comme un Magicarpe.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0200"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_select_02",
      "hash64": "04F745F15E1EA2B2",
      "text": "Quel « truc » ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_04",
      "hash64": "0E6C381207301F60",
      "text": "J’espère pour toi que tu dis la vérité...\\nSi tu me mens, tu me le paieras cher, crois-moi ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_05",
      "hash64": "0E6C391207302113",
      "text": "Mais si, tu sais ! Le « truc » !\\nQuand on a rencontré le Mons...\\r\\nJe veux dire, le monsieur de la montagne, là !\\c\\nTu sais très bien de quoi je parle, alors arrête\\nde me faire marcher, OK ?! T’es vraiment l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]ea pire ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 209,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 223,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_06",
      "hash64": "0E6C3A12073022C6",
      "text": "Bref, je voulais te parler du truc que t’as ramassé\\ndans les escaliers, hier soir.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_07",
      "hash64": "0E6C3B1207302479",
      "text": "Je pense qu’on devrait le montrer à mon papy.\\c\\nVu qu’il est incollable sur l’histoire du village,\\nil pourra peut-être éclairer notre lanterne.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_08",
      "hash64": "0E6C4412073033C4",
      "text": "Tu sais déjà où j’habite, donc rejoins-moi là-bas.\\nEt me fais pas attendre, cette fois-ci ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_09",
      "hash64": "0E6C451207303577",
      "text": "Va montrer à mon papy ce que t’as trouvé.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student1_01",
      "hash64": "9ECF9DCC98F6C72D",
      "text": "Ça craint ! J’ai trouvé qu’une seule pancarte !\\nC’est de la faute de Roseille, elle est jamais là...\\c\\nEnfin bon, elle est si indépendante et si cool,\\ncomment lui en vouloir ? Je... euh, non rien.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student2_01",
      "hash64": "459ADDB351A5A0BA",
      "text": "Kassis est un garçon très réservé, mais j’ai\\nremarqué qu’avec toi, il s’ouvre un peu plus.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student3_01",
      "hash64": "1B1CC9BE9B0E2E6F",
      "text": "Ça y est, je commence enfin à m’habituer\\naux Pokémon Insecte ! Hourra !\\c\\nPar contre, la chaleur et l’humidité, je m’y fais\\ntoujours pas !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "03895AFDBDF115D5",
      "text": "La Fête des Visages ne fait que commencer !\\nProfitez-en et amusez-vous bien ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
